==== Wave 4: Modlist

Wave 4 assumes the full foundational toolset — Navigraph (current nav data and charts are now load-bearing), LittleNavMap (briefing and planning), AviTab (plates in the cockpit), Better Pushback (gate departures) — plus everything added in Waves 1-3.

The wave's centerpiece aircraft is the *Boeing 737-800* (stock X-Plane 12 aircraft — no card needed; confirm it is present in your install's aircraft menu).

Per project rule, wave-specific mods come from you — cards below are *pending addition*, with the fields this guide's rules demand. Anything you do not supply stays *"user to provide"*.

